<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105181" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριπ-τήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>,
			ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίβω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pestle,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρπὸν . . λειαίνειν τριπτῆρι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					95
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				70.15
			</span></i>; <i>mortar</i> for grinding <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψιμύθιον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Lap.</u>
				56
			</span></i>; <i>board under the screw of a wine-</i> or <i>oil-press,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				494
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				308
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>vat into which wine</i> or <i>oil runs after being pressed
				out,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Is.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				24
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.151
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. δικῶν </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρὰ προσδοκίαν</span> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαῶν</span>), of a <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συκοφάντης</span> treated as an <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγγος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				937
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>horse-trough,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριπτῆρες τέτταρες τὰ ζεύγη ποτίζειν
					ἐν τῇ ὁδῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1673.21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκόνη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				308
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
